Description:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 - linuxmuster-linbo7
Changes:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 (1:7.4.21~edu1) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * Depend on edulution-linbo-gui7 instead of the virtual
     linuxmuster-linbo-gui7. A server upgraded from deb.linuxmuster.net kept
     the upstream linuxmuster-linbo-gui7, which satisfied the virtual
     dependency, so the edulution GUI never arrived there. apt now installs
     edulution-linbo-gui7 and, through its Conflicts/Replaces, removes the
     upstream GUI in the same run.
